<article id="compatibility"><h2>Compatibility</h2><p>Portable tests cover the core, settings, plugins and packaging. Native Workbench 3.2.1 / 68060 checks cover query history and favorites, result identity, Aminet completion fixtures, plugin settings and request recovery. A published 0.3 installation was upgraded to 0.4 with user files preserved; live AmiHASS checks confirmed a device action and restoration. Physical 68000 systems, minimum-memory configurations and every translated layout still need validation.</p><p>The main launcher uses workbench.library V44+ when available and a built-in fallback on older supported systems. Aminet’s Open drawer and Install completion actions require V44+; archive opening also needs a handler, and View readme uses MultiView.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/retrocs-org/beam68/blob/main/BUILD_STATUS.md">Detailed build and testing notes ↗</a></p></article></div></section>
